Package: pqview
Title: Fast, Serverless Data Frame Viewer in a Single HTML File
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Joseph", "Miller", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "jossammil@gmail.com")
Description: Browse a data frame or parquet file in the browser without a
    server. The data is embedded as compressed parquet inside one HTML file
    and read client-side, with a column picker, per-column filters (including
    regular expressions and inverted "everything but" filters), a SQL WHERE
    query bar, sorting, global search, summary statistics and CSV export.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/jossammil/pqview
BugReports: https://github.com/jossammil/pqview/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2)
Imports:
